# Unknown constructor keywords. Ruby raises before initialize's body runs, so
# the message names every unrecognised key in the order the caller gave them,
# rendered with Symbol#inspect. Ids uk_* in
# porting/evidence/query-filter-parse/unknown-keyword-{cases,ruby}.jsonl are
# the first three of these, recaptured here under corpus-style ids.
{"case_id":"query-filter-unknown-keyword-single","operation":"new","kwargs":{"nope":1}}
